tatus="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAKO YASUHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook> </applicant> <applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKANO MASARU</name> <address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKUBO TADASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YASKAWA DENKI SEISAKUSHO KK</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ZHANG WENNONG</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KABUSHIKI KAISHA YASKAWA DENKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAKU, YASUHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANO, MASARU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUBO, TADASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ZHANG, WENNONG</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAKO YASUHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKANO MASARU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKUBO TADASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ZHANG WENNONG</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAKU, YASUHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANO, MASARU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUBO, TADASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ZHANG, WENNONG</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A position controller for motors for increasing the position loop gain of a full-close control system without causing recurrence of vibration. The controller where a position signal representing the position of a movable table and outputted from straight-line motion position sensing means attached to a straight-line motion mechanism is used as a position feedback signal comprises differentiating means (2) for differentiating a straight-line motion position signal and outputting a straight-line motion speed signal, subtracting means (4) for calculating the difference between a speed command signal and the straight-line motion speed signal, integrating means (3) for integrating a difference signal outputted from the subtracting means, proportional gain means (1) for receiving the output signal from the integrating means, and adding means (19) for adding the output signal from the proportional gain means to the speed command signal and outputting a new speed command Vr.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette unité de commande de position pour moteurs est destinée à augmenter le gain de la boucle de position d'un système de commande opérationnel sans causer de vibration récurrente. Cette unité de commande dans laquelle un signal de position, représentant la position d'un plateau mobile et sorti par un mécanisme de détection de mouvement en ligne droite, est utilisé comme signal de rétroaction de position, comporte un différentiateur (2) permettant d'établir une distinction entre un signal de position de mouvement en ligne droite et de sortir un signal de vitesse de mouvement en ligne droite, un soustracteur (4) permettant de calculer la différence existant entre un signal de commande de régime et le signal de vitesse de mouvement en ligne droite, un intégrateur (3) permettant d'intégrer un signal de différence sorti par le soustracteur, une unité de gain proportionnel (1) recevant le signal de sortie émanant de l'intégrateur et un additionneur (19) additionnant le signal de sortie issu de l'unité de gain proportionnel au signal de commande de régime et sortant un nouveau vecteur de commande de régime.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>